Set Double Precision
Degree : Print #1,Sin(30);Cos(60);Tan(45);Asin(0.5);Acos(0.5);Atan(1)
Radian : Print #1,Sin(Pi#/6);Cos(0);Atan(1)*4
Print #1,Sqr(16);Exp(0);Ln(1);Log(1000);Abs(-2.5);Int(-2.5)
Print #1,Sqr(-1)
Print #1,Ln(-1)
ZF[1.5] : Print #1,Param#
X#=1.0E10 : Y#=X#*X# : Print #1,Y#
Print #1,Hsin(0);Hcos(0);Htan(0)
Fix 2 : Print #1,Pi# : Fix -1 : Print #1,Pi#
Procedure ZF[A#]
End Proc[A#*2]
